---
const cards = [
  { img: "b1R16Nkgvz2L6EUaX9klywT61c.png", title: "Au bord de la Sambre" },
  { img: "fTqizCj5ZHnhlU1Eiw2ixcK0.png", title: "Château & hébergement" },
  { img: "wMQO1IFTk82OAwti4KD5c2HNQvM.png", title: "Espaces de jeux et de partage" },
];
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-cream-2 py-[120px]">
  <div class="container-site">
    <!-- Header row -->
    <div class="flex flex-col items-start justify-between gap-8 lg:flex-row lg:items-end">
      <div class="relative">
        <span
          data-reveal
          class="inline-block -rotate-2 rounded-md bg-lime px-3 py-1 font-display text-[18px] leading-none text-forest"
        >
          Le domaine
        </span>
        <h2
          data-reveal
          data-reveal-delay="0.05"
          class="relative mt-4 max-w-[860px] font-display text-[44px] leading-[1.05] text-forest lg:text-[72px] lg:leading-[76px]"
        >
          Des espaces qui rendent le séjour unique
          <img
            src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}images/qi6XErSOH5xNf7R979ZatYl9rPE.svg`}
            alt=""
            aria-hidden="true"
            class="absolute right-24 top-0 hidden h-[37px] w-[45px] lg:block"
          />
        </h2>
      </div>
      <p
        data-reveal
        data-reveal-delay="0.1"
        class="max-w-[380px] font-heading text-[20px] leading-[32px] text-moss lg:pb-2"
      >
        Du château aux chalets, en passant par la plaine de jeux et le ravin,
        notre domaine de 5 hectares offre émerveillement et bien-être à chaque
        coin.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Cards -->
    <div class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3" data-stagger>
      {
        cards.map((c) => (
          <div
            data-reveal="scale"
            class="group relative h-[480px] overflow-hidden rounded-[28px]"
          >
            <img
              src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}images/${c.img}`}
              alt={c.title}
              class="h-full w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105"
            />
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 via-black/5 to-transparent" />
            <h3 class="absolute bottom-7 left-7 right-7 font-heading text-[32px] font-extrabold leading-[1.1] text-white">
              {c.title}
            </h3>
          </div>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
